vYxKyBia26.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvT3VyLUJlbG92ZWQtU3VtbWVyLSUyOFR2LXNlcmllcy0yMDIxJTI5LTEwODBwLw.1.8","title":"Before Sunset","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2021-12-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A forced vacation commences for Yeon-su and Ung when the documentary crew traps them at a mountain retreat. Awkward tensions run high between the pair.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3CujzN5XjbBlYiu2gfmIaL5q2lG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvT3VyLUJlbG92ZWQtU3VtbWVyLSUyOFR2LXNlcmllcy0yMDIxJTI5LTEwODBwLw.1.9","title":"Just Friends","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2022-01-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When she doesn't hear from Ung after their return from the retreat, Yeon-su decides to confront him. He has a disorienting response for her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sbZKf7m6sLo9PCuQaYAChMtpUEV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvT3VyLUJlbG92ZWQtU3VtbWVyLSUyOFR2LXNlcmllcy0yMDIxJTI5LTEwODBwLw.1.10","title":"Hello, My Soul Mate","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2022-01-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With his mother back in town, Ji-ung stops going home so he can avoid seeing her. Watching NJ and Ung go on a date vexes Yeon-su to no end.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ktDappwbwluL2En6woJoFpNAyVu.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvT3VyLUJlbG92ZWQtU3VtbWVyLSUyOFR2LXNlcmllcy0yMDIxJTI5LTEwODBwLw.1.11","title":"Our Nights Are More Beautiful Than Your Days","season":1,"episode":11,"released":"2022-01-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Ahead of the final day of filming, gossip about Ung and NJ causes a stir. Ji-ung receives pointed advice about his documentary edit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i48L1CneIBS3iFY9JKw4drleii3.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvT3VyLUJ